# [[.Name]]

A Weft app: Go and Vue in one binary. Theme: [[.Theme]].[[if .Tailwind]] Tailwind is on.[[end]]

```sh
weft dev      # run it while you work
weft build    # build the pages and the binary
```

The pages are in `web/pages`, the Go API in `api`. Weft's docs are at https://weft.base.al, and https://weft.base.al/llms.txt is the version for agents.
